WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.880
luke two in those days a decree went out from caesar augustus that all the world should be registered this was the first registration when quirinius was governor of syria

00:13.880 --> 00:26.140
and all went to be registered each to his own town and joseph also went up from galilee from the town of nazareth to judea to the city of david which is called bethlehem

00:26.140 --> 00:37.400
because he was of the house and lineage of david to be registered with mary his betrothed who was with child and while they were there the time came for her to give birth

00:37.400 --> 00:43.860
and she gave birth to her firstborn son and wrapped him in swaddling cloths and laid him in a manger

00:43.860 --> 00:52.400
because there was no place for them in the inn and in the same region there were shepherds out in the field keeping watch over their flock by night

00:52.400 --> 01:02.340
and an angel of the lord appeared to them and the glory of the lord shone around them and they were filled with fear and the angel said to them

01:03.000 --> 01:10.200
fear not for behold i bring you good news of great joy that will be for all the people

01:10.200 --> 01:13.840
for unto you is born this day in the city of

01:13.860 --> 01:22.440
david a savior who is christ the lord and this will be a sign for you you will find a baby

01:22.440 --> 01:29.660
wrapped in swaddling cloths and lying in a manger and suddenly there was with the angel a multitude

01:29.660 --> 01:37.520
of the heavenly host praising god and saying glory to god in the highest and on earth peace

01:37.520 --> 01:43.840
among those with whom he is pleased when the angels went away from them into heaven the shepherds

01:43.840 --> 01:48.820
said to one another let us go over to bethlehem and see this thing that has happened which the

01:48.820 --> 01:54.000
lord has made known to us and they went with haste and found mary and joseph and the baby

01:54.000 --> 01:59.900
lying in a manger and when they saw it they made known the saying that had been told them

01:59.900 --> 02:05.120
concerning this child and all who heard it wondered at what the shepherds told them

02:05.120 --> 02:11.540
but mary treasured up all these things pondering them in her heart and the shepherds returned

02:11.540 --> 02:13.540
glorifying and praising god

02:13.840 --> 02:20.160
for all they had heard and seen as it had been told them and at the end of eight days when he

02:20.160 --> 02:25.820
was circumcised he was called jesus the name given by the angel before he was conceived in the womb

02:25.820 --> 02:31.380
and when the time came for their purification according to the law of moses they brought him

02:31.380 --> 02:38.140
up to jerusalem to present him to the lord as it is written in the law of the lord every male who

02:38.140 --> 02:43.540
first opens the womb shall be called holy to the lord and to offer a

02:43.840 --> 02:49.880
sacrifice according to what is said in the law of the lord a pair of turtle doves or two young

02:49.880 --> 02:55.840
pigeons now there was a man in jerusalem whose name was simeon and this man was righteous and

02:55.840 --> 03:02.520
devout waiting for the consolation of israel and the holy spirit was upon him and it had been

03:02.520 --> 03:08.700
revealed to him by the holy spirit that he would not see death before he had seen the lord's christ

03:08.700 --> 03:13.700
and he came in the spirit into the temple and when the parents brought in the child

03:13.840 --> 03:19.840
jesus to do for him according to the custom of the law he took him up in his arms and blessed

03:19.840 --> 03:28.660
god and said lord now you're letting your servant depart in peace according to your word for my eyes

03:28.660 --> 03:34.960
have seen your salvation that you have prepared in the presence of all peoples a light for

03:34.960 --> 03:43.320
revelation to the gentiles and for glory to your people israel and his father and his mother marveled

03:43.840 --> 03:52.060
said about him and simeon blessed them and said to marry his mother behold this child is appointed

03:52.060 --> 04:00.480
for the fall and rising of many in israel and for a sign that is opposed and a sword will pierce

04:00.480 --> 04:08.580
through your own soul also so that thoughts from many hearts may be revealed and there was a

04:08.580 --> 04:12.520
prophetess anna the daughter of funuel of the tribe of asher

04:13.840 --> 04:24.180
she was a virgin and then as a widow until she was eighty-four she did not depart from the temple

04:24.180 --> 04:30.580
worshiping with fasting and prayer night and day and coming up at that very hour she began to give

04:30.580 --> 04:35.880
thanks to god and to speak of him to all who were waiting for the redemption of jerusalem

04:35.880 --> 04:43.040
and when they had performed everything according to the law of the lord they returned into galilee

04:43.040 --> 04:43.820
to their own home and to their own home and to their own home and to their own home and to their

04:43.840 --> 04:44.560
own

04:52.500 --> 04:56.680
are

04:56.680 --> 05:03.340
and when he was twelve years old they went up according to custom and when the feast was ended

05:03.340 --> 05:09.260
as they were returning the boy jesus stayed behind in jerusalem his parents did not know it

05:09.260 --> 05:13.820
but supposing him to be in the group they went a day's journey but then they went to the temple

05:13.840 --> 05:16.840
they began to search for him among their relatives and acquaintances.

05:17.480 --> 05:19.020
And when they did not find him,

05:19.420 --> 05:22.060
they returned to Jerusalem searching for him.

05:23.240 --> 05:25.720
After three days they found him in the temple,

05:26.160 --> 05:27.300
sitting among the teachers,

05:27.820 --> 05:29.840
listening to them and asking them questions.

05:30.640 --> 05:32.820
And all who heard him were amazed

05:32.820 --> 05:35.360
at his understanding and his answers.

05:36.060 --> 05:37.740
And when his parents saw him,

05:38.120 --> 05:39.180
they were astonished.

05:39.580 --> 05:41.100
And his mother said to him,

05:41.100 --> 05:44.080
Son, why have you treated us so?

05:44.640 --> 05:48.080
Behold, your father and I have been searching for you in great distress.

05:49.100 --> 05:50.100
And he said to them,

05:50.500 --> 05:52.260
Why were you looking for me?

05:52.560 --> 05:55.340
Did you not know that I must be in my father's house?

05:55.900 --> 05:59.340
And they did not understand the saying that he spoke to them.

05:59.780 --> 06:02.380
And he went down with them and came to Nazareth

06:02.380 --> 06:03.960
and was submissive to them.

06:04.460 --> 06:07.720
And his mother treasured up all these things in her heart.

06:08.140 --> 06:10.720
And Jesus increased in wisdom and in statutes,

06:11.100 --> 06:14.120
and in favor with God and man.

